    <briefdescription>
<para>extension of cci_param&lt;T, TM&gt; which automatically registeres a callback to restrict the valid values given to the parameter. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The parameter can be use with a restriction created by:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><ref refid="namespacescc_1af837755465d0c4911efaa87d2824e96a" kindref="member">min_max_restriction(T min, T max)</ref></para>
</listitem><listitem><para><ref refid="namespacescc_1a98553e045ed6ba303e915a1bc74bb8d7" kindref="member">min_max_excl_restriction(T min, T max)</ref></para>
</listitem><listitem><para><ref refid="namespacescc_1ae4fe172b09afbeb2fc67be93bf407388" kindref="member">min_restriction(T min)</ref>, <ref refid="namespacescc_1a0bfeb10cb76d710cc3f4f481db797f5f" kindref="member">gte_restriction(T min)</ref></para>
</listitem><listitem><para><ref refid="namespacescc_1a34b61cc3b88fe38fed8d3e79bce21509" kindref="member">min_excl_restriction(T min)</ref>, gt_excl_restriction(T min)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><ref refid="namespacescc_1acbe6e85e005ea75031c2162ebdf3f707" kindref="member">max_restriction(T max)</ref>, <ref refid="namespacescc_1ac619ebd656148900682d802d7ef5fa88" kindref="member">lte_restriction(T max)</ref></para>
</listitem><listitem><para><ref refid="namespacescc_1aae3871d3d47fa790ff8199b38a55400e" kindref="member">max_excl_restriction(T max)</ref>, <ref refid="namespacescc_1aca9573d6e004e93682a1b87adaa80a24" kindref="member">lt_excl_restriction(T max)</ref></para>
</listitem><listitem><para><ref refid="namespacescc_1a4ce9ef8bd8388134b8a4468f6f1bbe8b" kindref="member">discrete_restriction(std::initializer_list&lt;T&gt; values)</ref>, <ref refid="namespacescc_1a6a9ccf5781600af8bb997b45e9dedc75" kindref="member">discrete_restriction(std::array&lt;T, SZ&gt; values)</ref>, <ref refid="namespacescc_1a46ddf9cad4e03e3fb0063e743e1acfca" kindref="member">discrete_restriction(std::vector&lt;T&gt; values)</ref></para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
